  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990523/description_083d1bc3-9176-4699-921d-3387ee8c707d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"816\" height=\"278\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Better Weaponry — это мод, разработанный для расширения стандартного арсенала Minecraft путём добавления 15 новых наборов оружия, 7</strong><strong>&nbsp;новых зачарований, а</strong><strong>&nbsp;нового типа щита и их медных, аметистовых и изумрудных аналогов. Совместим с </strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Better Combat</span></a></strong><strong> !</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Кинжалы :</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990523/description_d5c3b887-6026-4773-bab6-6c9f41eaa3af.png\" width=\"648\" height=\"72\"></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990523/description_6d1f2ff7-b337-42f8-9165-b45e8d8ca275.png\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Серпы :</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990523/description_89e01b2e-2395-448c-b8f4-bf1acedff215.png\" width=\"648\" height=\"72\"></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990523/description_4c76585a-785b-42a9-bc16-79a10e0faf21.png\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Рапиры :</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990523/description_a749ffff-2d38-4563-8e6b-8c372f5b5fa2.png\" width=\"648\" height=\"72\"></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990523/description_75b05dbc-5eac-4cef-be41-c90279d3b111.png\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Корсики :</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990523/description_5f3c21bd-6871-4d9d-82eb-58eea645e2d5.png\" width=\"648\" height=\"72\"></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990523/description_0e964a86-e283-494c-93e2-2729f48f1303.png\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Шамширы :</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990523/description_98384c6a-b493-4b30-ac89-5bdf77047e59.png\" width=\"648\" height=\"72\"></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990523/description_af0579ac-2b58-4c1a-a609-756efd7c22ae.png\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Копья :</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990523/description_44fb0036-d7f2-4073-bd79-57caebf61f17.png\" width=\"648\" height=\"72\"></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990523/description_ccf17574-5e2c-45b5-8dc0-ff3f2d20648c.png\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Катианы :</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990523/description_62539bd1-dd38-4139-a9ea-bd4f6007ced7.png\" width=\"648\" height=\"72\"></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990523/description_e1087814-d67b-4d13-91ca-e975a60da699.png\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Боевые топоры :</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990523/description_3aaf95d6-08c1-4fea-a1a5-047edc9131b7.png\" width=\"648\" height=\"72\"></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990523/description_ed6b7538-c296-4b83-844d-a42c7b0f7e05.png\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Глефы :</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990523/description_3698bef3-0be9-44b6-bdfe-e5a8fcf9367f.png\" width=\"648\" height=\"72\"></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990523/description_8d59c187-71ef-4e80-a307-9404693586bf.png\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Молоты :</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990523/description_56bb8ab3-90a2-43be-bea0-f4a729591a3f.png\" width=\"648\" height=\"72\"></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990523/description_ced2a9e8-1481-4158-ad21-8d6cf130ef4e.png\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Широкие мечи :</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990523/description_9980b120-b959-44d3-ac31-578537bf5e75.png\" width=\"648\" height=\"72\"></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990523/description_9d88ff10-6b3e-459f-a950-615780a46f1f.png\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Клейморы :</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990523/description_f4c7d4b3-aeda-4362-b080-25f506ea148e.png\" width=\"648\" height=\"72\"></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990523/description_f4c3a268-191b-444a-8a08-cebf558f436b.png\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Сюрикены :</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990523/description_30c4a934-c3df-43a9-a6f0-ed7e2d2dc20f.png\" width=\"648\" height=\"72\"></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990523/description_ce1fbd01-5f9a-4ea4-9f2d-dbe7339c8a1a.png\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Чакрыммы :</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990523/description_33243729-1b3f-4d08-b1a0-dbf4a504df68.png\" width=\"648\" height=\"72\"></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990523/description_732d3116-7134-42e1-8f90-85043dff2fdd.png\" width=\"495\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Сайи :</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990523/description_c8b3aa2a-b9de-4bf6-b6e2-de3538797562.png\" width=\"648\" height=\"72\"></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990523/description_6e3c4600-3aa0-4db0-9557-92d0ed8495da.png\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Щиты :</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990523/description_6d5d697b-1b21-4bf5-b5cd-a6c73f7de3c3.png\" width=\"648\" height=\"72\"></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990523/description_7e16f76f-66b8-47f2-ad02-bc1aa8be1128.png\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Зачарования :</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>Вампиризм : Восстанавливает часть здоровья пользователя при нанесении урона.<br>Ядовитый : Наносит отравление цели.<br>Оглушающий : Замедляет цель.<br>Ослепляющий : Ослепляет цель.<br><br>Урон : Увеличивает урон, наносимый сюрикенами.<br>Отталкивание : Увеличивает отбрасывание, наносимое сюрикенами.<br><br>Притяжение : Делает отбрасывание луков отрицательным, притягивая цели к пользователю.</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em>Вы можете добавить Better Weaponry в свой модпак!</em></p>",
